@AtlasShrug1 I read your post about wives trading CIEN and mogging their husbands.

It is not a contrarian viewpoint to expect a crash at some point however, shouldn't we just let human emotions and cycles run their course and appreciate our lunacy?

I do find this market fascinating - in that consumer sentiment is so low but the market is so high. In 99 they were both together. Feels like there's disagreement, tension. I am not sure we are the stage where my GF is running options on micron.
